cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Vox Trust Protocol"
abstract: >-
  An open protocol, with a Rust reference implementation, that seals a human
  voice at the source so that anyone can later verify which key sealed it,
  when, and which parts were altered. Pre-alpha; the specification is a draft.
type: software
authors:
